<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">

<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>協尋登記 - FurFriend Finder</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<style>
		:root {
			--bg-color: #FEFBF6;
			--text-color: #5D5753;
			--heading-color: #A77B5A;
			--primary-color: #81A6D3;
			--card-bg-color: #FFFFFF;
			--shadow-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
			--border-color: #EAE0D5;
		}

		body {
			font-family: 'Nunito', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif;
			line-height: 1.8;
			padding: 20px;
			background-color: var(--bg-color);
			color: var(--text-color);
		}

		.container {
			max-width: 800px;
			margin: 40px auto;
			background-color: var(--card-bg-color);
			padding: 40px;
			border-radius: 20px;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--shadow-color);
		}

		h1 {
			color: var(--heading-color);
			text-align: center;
			font-size: 2.2em;
		}

		.intro-text {
			text-align: center;
			margin-bottom: 40px;
		}

		form>fieldset {
			border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
			border-radius: 15px;
			padding: 25px;
			margin-bottom: 30px;
		}

		form>fieldset>legend {
			padding: 0 15px;
			font-size: 1.5em;
			font-weight: bold;
			color: var(--heading-color);
		}

		.form-group {
			margin-bottom: 20px;
		}

		label {
			display: block;
			margin-bottom: 8px;
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 1.1em;
		}

		input,
		select,
		textarea {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 12px;
			border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
			border-radius: 10px;
			box-sizing: border-box;
			font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
			font-size: 1em;
			transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
		}

		input:focus,
		select:focus,
		textarea:focus {
			outline: none;
			border-color: var(--primary-color);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(129, 166, 211, 0.3);
		}

		.submit-button {
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			padding: 15px 35px;
			background-color: var(--primary-color);
			color: white;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 50px;
			cursor: pointer;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-size: 1.2em;
			font-weight: bold;
			transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
		}

		.submit-button:hover {
			transform: translateY(-3px);
			box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(129, 166, 211, 0.5);
		}

		/* Header Styles */
		.main-header {
			position: sticky;
			top: 0;
			z-index: 1000;
			background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
			backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
			box-shadow: 0 2px 10px var(--shadow-color);
			padding: 10px 0;
		}

		.header-container {
			max-width: 800px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 0 20px;
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
		}

		.logo {
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 1.4em;
			color: var(--heading-color);
			text-decoration: none;
		}

		.main-nav a {
			margin-left: 25px;
			text-decoration: none;
			color: var(--text-color);
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 1.1em;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.main-nav a:hover {
			color: var(--primary-color);
		}
	</style>
</head>

<body>
	<%- include('partials/_header') %>
		<div class="container">
			<h1>協尋寵物資料登記</h1>
			<p class="intro-text">請盡可能詳細地填寫以下資訊，以提高配對成功率。</p>

			<form action="/api/lost-animals" method="POST">
				<fieldset>
					<legend>🐾 走失寵物資料</legend>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-name">寵物名字</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-name" name="animalLost[name]">
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-chip-id">晶片號碼</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-chip-id" name="animalLost[chip_id]">
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-lost-time">走失時間</label>
						<input type="date" id="pet-lost-time" name="animalLost[lost_time]">
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-kind">物種</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-kind" name="animalLost[kind]" placeholder="例如: 狗, 貓" required>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-variety">品種</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-variety" name="animalLost[variety]" placeholder="例如: 米克斯, 貴賓">
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-sex">性別</label>
						<select id="pet-sex" name="animalLost[sex]">
							<option value="">未知</option>
							<option value="M">公</option>
							<option value="F">母</option>
						</select>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-colour">毛色</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-colour" name="animalLost[colour]" placeholder="例如: 虎斑, 橘色, 黑白">
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-outlook">外觀</label>
						<textarea id="pet-outlook" name="animalLost[outlook]" rows="2"
							placeholder="例如: 親人、膽小、左耳有剪耳"></textarea>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-feature">特徵</label>
						<textarea id="pet-feature" name="animalLost[feature]" rows="2"
							placeholder="例如: 尾巴是麒麟尾、項圈是藍色的"></textarea>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-lost-place">走失地點</label>
						<input type="text" id="pet-lost-place" name="animalLost[lost_place]" required>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="pet-remark">走失原因</label>
						<textarea id="pet-remark" name="animalLost[remark]" rows="4"
							placeholder="例如: 當時天氣、走失的可能原因等"></textarea>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<fieldset>
					<legend>👤 飼主聯絡資訊</legend>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="owner-name">您的姓名</label>
						<input type="text" id="owner-name" name="animalOwner[name]" required>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="owner-email">Email</label>
						<input type="email" id="owner-email" name="animalOwner[email]" required>
					</div>
					<div class="form-group">
						<label for="owner-phone">手機</label>
						<input type="tel" id="owner-phone" name="animalOwner[phone]">
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<button type="submit" class="submit-button">提交協尋案件</button>
			</form>
		</div>
</body>

</html>
